 # Rotation Transformation
 
-Also called: Axis-Angle Rotation, Euler Angle Rotation, Rotation Matrix Construction
 
 ## Overview
-Rotation Transformation constructs a 4×4 homogeneous rotation matrix to rotate a shape or vector around a specified axis by a given angle [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial]. It solves the problem of defining rigid body orientation changes in 3D space for volume rendering ray casting. It sets itself apart from [Quaternion Rotation](2302-quaternion-rotation.md) by yielding an explicit matrix representation rather than using quaternion algebra, and from [SE2 Lie Group Implementation](3144-se2-lie-group-implementation.md) by operating in 3D space rather than 2D.
