 ## Background
-Rotation Transformation is a fundamental concept in computer graphics and geometry processing. The axis-angle representation is derived from Euler's rotation theorem. The Euler angle decomposition is widely used in camera models and robotics. The vector-to-vector rotation formula is a variant of Rodrigues' rotation formula. These methods are implemented in various volume rendering projects for ray generation and camera pose updates [S1, unofficial][S3, unofficial][S4, unofficial].
